<title>USA: Cabletron Systems sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Cabletron Systems sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.H. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cabletron Systems Inc said Monday it has set a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record at the close of business November 7 will be entitled to the stock dividend, which will be distributed November 26.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the stock split, Cabletron will have about 151.4 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
